# Dependency graph

Show Call Hierarchy on a name: outgoing calls are what it reads, incoming
calls are what reads it.

[$4,800]:income
[$1,900]:rent
[$650]:groceries
[fixed_costs] := rent + groceries
[free_cash] := income - fixed_costs
[savings_goal] := free_cash * 0.4

- [ ] Confirm the budget :budget_ok @after(free_cash > $1000)
- [ ] Set up the transfer @after(budget_ok)

<!-- On free_cash: outgoing shows income and fixed_costs; incoming shows
savings_goal and the tasks that depend on it. -->
